#: fonts.cpp:636
msgid "Force fonts DPI:"
msgstr "Foirci les DPI des fontes:"

#: fonts.cpp:641
msgid "96 DPI"
msgstr "96 DPI"

#: fonts.cpp:642
msgid "120 DPI"
msgstr "120 DPI"

#: fonts.cpp:644
msgid ""
"<p>This option forces a specific DPI value for fonts. It may be useful when the "
"real DPI of the hardware is not detected properly and it is also often misused "
"when poor quality fonts are used that do not look well with DPI values other "
"than 96 or 120 DPI.</p>"
"<p>The use of this option is generally discouraged. For selecting proper DPI "
"value a better option is explicitly configuring it for the whole X server if "
"possible (e.g. DisplaySize in xorg.conf or adding <i>-dpi value</i> "
"to ServerLocalArgs= in $KDEDIR/share/config/kdm/kdmrc). When fonts do not "
"render properly with real DPI value better fonts should be used or "
"configuration of font hinting should be checked.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cisse tchuze foirci ene sipecifike valixhance di DPI po les fontes. Ele "
"pôreut esse ahessåve cwand l' vraiy valixhance di DPI di l' éndjolreye n' est "
"nén trové comifåt et est sovint må eployeye cwand des fontes di mwaijhe cwålité "
"ki n' dinèt nén bén cwand ele sont eployeyes avou des ôtès valixhanceski 96 ou "
"120 DPI.</p> "
"<p>Eployî cisse tchuze est sovint nén rcomandé. Po tchoezi l' bone valixhance "
"DPI, ene meyeuse tchuze est l' aponteye bén po tot l' sierveu X si possibe (eg. "
"DisplaySize dins xorg.conf oudonbén radjouter <i>-dpi value</i> "
"a ServerLocalArgs= dins $KDEDIR/share/config/kdm/kdmrc). Cwand les fontes n' "
"håynèt nén comifåt avou ene vraiy valixhance DPI, des fontes di meyeuse cwålité "
"divént esse eployeye po l' apontiaedje oudonbén li halo di fontes divreut esse "
"verifyî.</p>"

#: fonts.cpp:761
msgid ""
"<p>Some changes such as anti-aliasing will only affect newly started "
"applications.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kékes candjmints come li lissaedje ni rotront ki so les noveas programes.</p>"

